Must-do (client-architecture.md §11):

- W5: move native/bridge.ts to platform/native/ at bridge version 2 (§5.10), then delete native/
  and its lint exemption in lint/rules.js.
- L4 (daemon): an `input` or `paste` the daemon refuses (`busy`, `inputTooLarge`) names no request, so
  `net/host.ts` drops the error. Once it does, a refused paste can say "Not pasted", and
  screens/terminal/terminals.ts can stop leaning on its 8 ms input batching to survive a burst.
- Settings (W1): a fresh install has no way to add a Files root; it means editing `config.toml` on
  the host. The `/fs/roots/*` client methods in files/api.ts are kept for this.
